<title>UK: SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS AND LATEST POSITIONS. [CORRECTED 21:58 GMT]</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS AND LATEST POSITIONS. [CORRECTED 21:58 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>World snooker</p>
<p>championship results on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round (best-of-25 frames)</p>
<p>4-John Parrott (England) beat Anthony Hamilton (England) 13-11</p>
<p>2-John Higgins (Scotland) beat Dominic Dale (Wales) 13-5</p>
<p>12-James Wattana (Thailand) beat Stephen Lee (England) 13-7</p>
<p>(Corrects to make clear John Higgins beat Dominic Dale)</p>
</text>
